{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天是文化之日。", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為待在家裡也沒事做，所以我跟櫻乃出門購物。", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃沒有什麼想要的東西嗎？」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「跟哥哥在一起的時間，無價。」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "sk1042", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「又說這種讓我高興的話。」", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「試著扮演討人喜歡的妹妹。」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "sk1043", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃不用演就是討人喜歡的妹妹了。」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「才不是呢。」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "sk1044", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看來她不是想要我贊同討人喜歡這點。", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「葛格沒有想要的東西嗎？」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "sk1045", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「跟妹妹在一起的時間，無價。」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 168, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "sk1046", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這種時候……不說討人喜歡的哥哥嗎？」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「葛格就是葛格。」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "sk1047", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，說的也是。」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看來今天是沒有特定目的的逛街了。", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳不會想要新衣服之類的東西嗎？」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃這個年紀的女孩，好像都會把錢花在那方面。」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「浪費錢是不好的。」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "sk1048", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃真是節儉啊。」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「輸給愛理了。」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "sk1049", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳們兩個都是很罕見的類型。」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為這附近人潮比較多，所以我們牽著手走路。", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這個避免迷路的行為，從小時候開始就沒有改變。", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃喜歡什麼樣的衣服？」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……最近喜歡有邊邊的。」", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "sk1050", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「邊邊？」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「像安潔穿的那種。」", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "sk1051", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，邊邊是指荷葉邊啊。」", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「邊邊。」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "sk1052", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看來她很堅持這個叫法。", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「天羽學姊好像也很適合。」", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "sk1053", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「或許吧，那個人感覺就是個大小姐。」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「忌妒天羽學姊穿邊邊的可愛。」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "sk1054", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……總之，妳不要一直說邊邊啦。」", "text_idx": 170, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "擦身而過的人都忍不住回頭看她。", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「葛格，不想看妹妹的邊邊嗎？」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "sk1055", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 168, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我一瞬間不知道該做何反應。", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「請參考看看～」", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 259, "voice": "mu0440", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "來到車站前，我聽見一個熟悉的聲音。", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不好意思，請參考看看～」", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 259, "voice": "mu0441", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「！？」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不禁懷疑自己的眼睛。", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那是天羽學姊吧？", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "為什麼穿成那樣……", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「請參考看看……」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 259, "voice": "mu0442", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她遞出一包夾著廣告的面紙，我也下意識地收下。", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，瓜生君。」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 259, "voice": "mu0443", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「天羽學姊。」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "sk1057", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這種偶遇，我不知道該做什麼反應才好。", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她長著翅膀、貓耳……而且居然非常合適。", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你們兩位是出門逛街嗎？」", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 259, "voice": "mu0444", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，想說買點東西。」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「天羽學姊在做什麼呢？」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我在做發廣告面紙的打工喔。」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 259, "voice": "mu0445", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我低頭看面紙上的廣告，上面印了一間在車站附近的女僕咖啡廳的介紹。", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔喫茶？」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "sk1058", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「學姊，妳在女僕咖啡廳打工嗎？」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是，我只是發面紙而已。」", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 259, "voice": "mu0446", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「女僕咖啡廳……很流行。」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "sk1059", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃，我倒覺得有點退流行了……」", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過我很意外。", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那個像天使一樣的天羽學姊，居然會打扮成這樣在打工……", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過，明明是女僕咖啡廳卻沒穿女僕裝，是經營者的興趣嗎……", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥，想要這個。」", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "sk1060", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哪個？」", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「天羽學姊的邊邊。」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "sk1061", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「邊邊？」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 259, "voice": "mu0447", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊！是指學姊穿的衣服啦！」", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "聽到學姊說出「邊邊」兩個字我連忙說明。", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是這件衣服穿起來有點不好意思呢。站在這種地方又非常顯眼……」", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 259, "voice": "mu0448", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她就是為了招攬客人才站在這裡的，這也沒辦法。不過這套衣服實在很能刺激男人……", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "更不用說穿著的人是天羽學姊了。", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為認識在學校裡溫和的學姊，所以更覺得現在的打扮反差很大。", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真辛苦，假日還要打工。」", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也想趕快結束，然後去社團教室呢～」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 259, "voice": "mu0449", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "打工結束後還要去照顧動物嗎？", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果不是真心喜歡，是做不到這種程度的吧。", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥也來幫忙？」", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "sk1062", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不了，身為男生的我幫忙是沒有效果的。」", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「鎖定女性客群。」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 254, "voice": "sk1063", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「畢竟是女僕咖啡廳，就算偶爾有女孩子去也是少數。」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生君有去過女僕咖啡廳嗎？」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 259, "voice": "mu0450", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒有，我不太習慣那種店。」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔呼呼，果然跟我想的一樣。」", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 259, "voice": "mu0451", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我就在想瓜生君應該是那樣。」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 259, "voice": "mu0452", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原來我給她那種感覺嗎？", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過隼太倒是很喜歡那種店。", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……抱歉，拉著你們聊了這麼久。」", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 259, "voice": "mu0453", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不會，我們才是，打擾妳打工了。」", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 251, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒關係，跟瓜生君你們聊天很快樂喔～」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 259, "voice": "mu0454", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然場所和服裝都不同，但天羽學姊的笑容沒有改變。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這個人的笑容，才是真的無價。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
